  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - "The witch carefully aims her lightning at Natsuki.\t"
  - The witch launches shocking orbs and fire that seems to have a mind of its own.
  - The witch fires a large fireball that orbits Natsuki, flinging fire toward her.
  - The witch launches a bunch of splitting ice spikes.
  - The witch, with less care than before, barrages Natsuki with lightning.
  - The witch unleashes a large burst of frost toward Natsuki.
